# Worker secrets / local overrides
#
# Copy to `.dev.vars` (git-ignored) for local development.
# `.dev.vars` must NEVER be committed.
#
# NOTE: Phase 1 stores no secrets. There is no API key because Workers AI
# is called by the Worker itself. This file exists for future phases.

# Uncomment to point local dev at a fixture instead of the live site.
# SITE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8766

# Comma-separated browser origins allowed to call the Worker.
# This is the browser ORIGIN (scheme + host), never a path.
# ALLOWED_ORIGINS=https://happysadmi.github.io